{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7000_situation", "source_sha256": "df7e905582089f19789355d95376536c02e33291bec3890e35ab61b7a6d69c3a", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7000_place", "source_sha256": "7d9949f09e9b39ef3eacfd0835b298df6aa8d9c75d4446584715fdb1b9131f71", "ja": "雪原", "zh": "雪原", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7001_p", "source_sha256": "45a92a90c3906de7f13bf24eba1004d7bd0cdf83c5bfd4ba1ac692f37a744ca6", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。イエティの\n日常という変わったテーマだが、恵美の様子は……）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄日。主题是雪怪的\n日常生活这个奇特的题材，不过，惠美的样子……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7002_020meg", "source_sha256": "e0fdb4ea2625ee1f3560360229352f0964f625a872b5c4272507e458e4aa0f38", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}。イエティって\nどんなオシャレして、カワイくしてると思う？", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}，你觉得雪怪会打扮得多时髦、多可爱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7003_p", "source_sha256": "9cdedc76a5278b5d3c3bc7ed7914ec9442822cf4c2be76189c3e6bbb20b704c4", "ja": "イエティがオシャレ……？", "zh": "雪人也会打扮……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7004_020meg", "source_sha256": "9d78dc74805be0e204128c1faf008bec79963b8563190634cdf866e93cf691c3", "ja": "うん！　アタシが毎日してることって、やっぱ\nオシャレでしょ。だからイエティも同じかなって♪", "zh": "嗯！我每天都在做的事，果然很时髦吧。  \n所以我就想，雪怪应该也一样吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7005_020meg", "source_sha256": "ce9de881351937a76df9081c7393c17905b5b5bc62e20a0651bfced00d598d90", "ja": "他のイエティよりカワイくなりたーいとか、思ってて\nほしいんだけど……。うまくイメージができなくて。", "zh": "我希望你能想着“想变得比其他雪怪更可爱”之类的……可是，我实在想象不出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7006_p", "source_sha256": "5be4f42e9506b3bc9d519114ccd6c212333de7a970f818ae6a57f2f723626291", "ja": "確かに難しそうだな……。\nうーん、イエティにもできそうなところだと……。", "zh": "确实感觉挺难的……\n嗯，要说雪人也能做到的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7007", "source_sha256": "d4d9d3939a2aef765eceed00499d471e60232bc9c53431e943cbb46ac1e71639", "ja": "メイクをする", "zh": "化妆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7008", "source_sha256": "678c8108bec274a6228a915c6b9ad441734f5c46532a54d5d6e8e3e10ad3e0b7", "ja": "入念なお手入れ", "zh": "细致护理", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7200_p", "source_sha256": "7bd839380182813ca46c67b40b69f037bed803e543ef915f696f6e45c695d4f3", "ja": "オシャレといえば、メイクじゃないか。\n木の実の汁で、体に色を付けるとかどうだ？", "zh": "说到打扮，那就是化妆了吧。\n用树果的汁液在身上涂抹颜色，这样如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7201_020meg", "source_sha256": "3bd7994b965b18f8bb0d7b5fd3427f16a81f774d338aa05e392be0e7083e7329", "ja": "わあ～、すっごくカワイイね！　それなら、カラフルな\n木の実を見ながら迷ってるシーンとか、どうかな？", "zh": "哇～，太可爱了吧！那加一段看着五颜六色的\n树果犹豫不决的场景，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7202_020meg", "source_sha256": "f2b16027f57816b831e16ed0fa924df0929713d675cdaf00804fe0858e6e4c00", "ja": "アタシも、ネイル選ぶ時、メッチャ迷うからさ。\nイエティにも、そんな日があってもいいよね♪", "zh": "我挑美甲的时候也超级纠结嘛。\n雪怪偶尔也有这种时候，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7300_p", "source_sha256": "7bd839380182813ca46c67b40b69f037bed803e543ef915f696f6e45c695d4f3", "ja": "オシャレといえば、メイクじゃないか。\n木の実の汁で、体に色を付けるとかどうだ？", "zh": "说到打扮，那就是化妆了吧。\n用树果的汁液在身上涂抹颜色，这样如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7301_020meg", "source_sha256": "6b8957683076aa71f2f6fff9a0af2d0f23923ca617b1f326ba772dc9c0cbc8c2", "ja": "メイクいいね～！　って、身近にあるものを使わなきゃ\nダメだよね？　雪山って、何があるんだろう……。", "zh": "化妆不错～！不过，得用身边找得到的东西才行吧？雪山上会有什么呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7302_020meg", "source_sha256": "0b6b304a5b1416625db3b16dd1b6deaae09d9e7cee46747989766d6133f4d88e", "ja": "木の実に葉っぱ……あとは石とか？　……あっ！\nそういう探してる姿も日常っぽくていいかも！", "zh": "树果、叶子……还有石头之类的？……啊！\n像这样寻找素材的样子，也很有日常感，不是挺好的吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7500_p", "source_sha256": "afa9cc229a1a3c08e4d8ea94ec6f8a283878407bb0bbeba5cac2fcf3ac6df22a", "ja": "イエティは、全身がモフモフだろう？\n毛並みのお手入れは、オシャレにならないかな。", "zh": "雪人全身都毛茸茸的吧？\n打理毛发算不算一种时尚呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7501_020meg", "source_sha256": "9a8141e783b60c3b5f1e6f5400aafe8ef32be8d49a97cbeda364c05f23f5325b", "ja": "なるなる！　あれだけモフモフしてるなら、\n髪型……っていうかわからないけど、遊べそうだよね！", "zh": "对对！既然全身都毛茸茸的，发型……该怎么说呢，总之可以好好打扮一番吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7502_020meg", "source_sha256": "f80ce313e92d5071d27e98c0c5f8949f5acf8bb5e888fb7e7ea4609df8048726", "ja": "カワイイ髪型で、みんなから注目を浴びて……\nイエティ界のアイドルになっちゃうなんて、どう♪", "zh": "梳个可爱的发型，吸引大家的目光……成为雪怪界的偶像，怎么样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7600_p", "source_sha256": "afa9cc229a1a3c08e4d8ea94ec6f8a283878407bb0bbeba5cac2fcf3ac6df22a", "ja": "イエティは、全身がモフモフだろう？\n毛並みのお手入れは、オシャレにならないかな。", "zh": "雪人全身都毛茸茸的吧？\n打理毛发算不算一种时尚呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7601_020meg", "source_sha256": "edb296db2ba9fcdc2887fa6359bac9818c01dbfd3275f4b8e7624adf061ecb0e", "ja": "確かに！　あのモフモフって洋服みたいなものでしょ？\n毛を短くして、寒さを我慢してる子とかいそうだよね！", "zh": "确实！那身毛茸茸的不就像衣服一样嘛？\n感觉肯定有把毛剪短、忍着寒冷的孩子呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_7602_020meg", "source_sha256": "ecd0ecf9f95f20ebeafbdaee77dc775d60ab2bc66b1e38afc9c2fe5f3b3e5586", "ja": "アタシは肌見せコーデとか、よくやるけど……。\nイエティのコーデって、どんな感じなんだろう？", "zh": "我平时经常穿露肤搭配，不过……\n雪人的穿搭，会是什么样的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
